# Twinkle Twinkle opening for the Inkplate buzzer probe (prepared demo).
#
# One RTTTL score per line; blank lines and `#` comments are skipped.
# Original timing arrangement of the public-domain melody (first two lines).
# Regenerate the firmware module after any change; see
# docs/guides/audio/buzzer-listening.md for the exact command.
twinkle:d=8,o=6,b=120:c.,16p,c.,16p,g.,16p,g.,16p,a.,16p,a.,16p,4g.,8p,f.,16p,f.,16p,e.,16p,e.,16p,d.,16p,d.,16p,4c.,8p
